name statue
# Statue Park (tools/bot/objectives.py assets/obseg/setup/u/UsetupstatueZ.c).
#   0 contact Valentin (flag 0x100): Valentin (chr 1, AI list 0x412, near -4440,-158,4860) starts talking once HE sees Bond
#     (his list waits on line of sight, so the bot stands in front of him), then counts ~30 s while Bond stays close
#   1 confront Janus (0x400)  2 the flight recorder's location (0x200)  3 rescue Natalya (0x800)  4 collect the recorder
#     (tag 1: ai_xx moves it to one of several pads at random)
# Walking into the room of pad 22 (room 10) ends the mission at once (ai_42: fade and exit_level): that was the "ends at
# 10 s" of the first campaign. Keep out of it until the end.
#   Janus (objective 1): ai_36 spawns him (chr 8, AI list 0x413 = ai_19) at pad 54 once objective 0 is done and Bond is
#   near pad 59; ai_19 talks on a timer and sets 0x400 after 10 s (600 ticks) - a shot from Bond near him ends it
#   (if_guard_shot_from_bond_missed). So: go to pad 59, hold fire, stay with him a while.
avoid pad 22
obj=0 meet ai 0x412 150 4000
obj=1 goto pad 59 60
obj=1 peace 1
obj=1 meet ai 0x413 250 900
peace 0
auto
avoid pad -1
goto pad 22 80
exit
